## In-process request path (bench_h2: h2_process + kv_grpc_run_batch + conn_window_refill on one thread, no sockets, no kernel).
## 1,024 keys in cache, 16 requests per read, 100-byte values; minimum over 15 interleaved rounds per variant, vCPU 9.
## head2 = 5735d7a; landA = + four audit patches + any-length replies; big = landA + AES key hash;
## landC = big + protobuf fast path, inline stream open/close, located buckets; fuse = landC + fused HEADERS+DATA.

# GET
head2  min  120.34 ns/request   median  121.58   rounds within 2% of min: 10/15
landA  min  103.25 ns/request   median  103.98   rounds within 2% of min: 14/15
big    min   88.26 ns/request   median   89.73   rounds within 2% of min: 10/15
landC  min   76.07 ns/request   median   76.45   rounds within 2% of min: 14/15
fuse   min   68.55 ns/request   median   68.82   rounds within 2% of min: 15/15

